{"id": "16-1485-2-2", "zh": "以 s 结尾的词根", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1486-2-4", "zh": "sā，意思是“煮熟”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1486-5-6", "zh": "sāti（煮熟）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1487-2-4", "zh": "si，意思是“亲近、侍奉”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1487-5-6", "zh": "sevati（亲近、侍奉）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1487-7-16", "zh": "sevanā（亲近）、sevako（侍者）、sevito（被亲近的）、sivo（湿婆）、sivaṃ（吉祥）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1488-2-5", "zh": "亲近卑劣者的人会日渐衰退，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1489-2-7", "zh": "亲近与自己相当的人，永远不会衰退；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1490-2-5", "zh": "亲近最优秀的人，就会很快提升，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1491-2-6", "zh": "所以应当亲近比自己更优秀的人。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1492-2-4", "zh": "si，意思是“行走”和“增长”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1492-5-8", "zh": "seti、atiseti（超越）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1492-9-14", "zh": "atisituṃ（为了超越）、atisitvā（超越之后）、setu（桥）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1493-2-5", "zh": "sī，意思是“躺卧”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1493-6-8", "zh": "saya 就是睡眠。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1493-9-10", "zh": "seti（躺卧）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1493-11-12", "zh": "sayati（躺卧）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1493-13-14", "zh": "senaṃ（卧处）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1493-15-16", "zh": "sayanaṃ（床座、卧处）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1494-2-4", "zh": "su，意思是“行走”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1494-5-6", "zh": "savati（行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1494-7-8", "zh": "pasavati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1494-9-12", "zh": "pasuto、suto（使者）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1495-2-29", "zh": "这里的 **suto** 是“使者”的意思；“使者啊，看到你，我就得到了喜悦”和“天神的使者摩多梨”，这些就是它在经典中的用例。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1496-2-4", "zh": "su，意思是“流出”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1496-5-7", "zh": "savana 就是流动。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1496-8-9", "zh": "savati（流出）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1496-10-11", "zh": "āsavo（漏）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1497-2-4", "zh": "sū，意思是“生出”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1497-5-7", "zh": "pasava 就是产生。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1497-8-11", "zh": "savati、pasavati（生出）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1497-12-13", "zh": "suttaṃ（经）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1498-2-18", "zh": "这里的 suttaṃ，是因为它能产生意义，所以叫做 sutta，指三藏佛语；或者此外如《象经》之类的典籍也叫做 sutta。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-1499-2-4", "zh": "sū，意思是“生出生命、分娩”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1499-5-6", "zh": "sūti（生产）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1499-7-8", "zh": "pasūti（生产）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1499-9-10", "zh": "pasūto（所生的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1500-2-4", "zh": "su，意思是“驱使、推动”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1500-5-6", "zh": "suti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1501-2-4", "zh": "se，意思是“消亡、灭尽”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1501-5-6", "zh": "sīyati（消亡）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1501-7-11", "zh": "这是把 e 音替换为 īya。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1502-2-4", "zh": "se，意思是“煮熟”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1502-5-6", "zh": "seti（煮熟）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1503-2-4", "zh": "se，意思是“行走”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1503-5-6", "zh": "seti（行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1503-7-8", "zh": "setu（桥）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1504-2-4", "zh": "hiṃsa，意思是“伤害”。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1504-5-6", "zh": "hiṃsati（伤害）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1504-7-12", "zh": "hiṃsako（伤害者）、hiṃsanā（伤害）、hiṃsā（伤害）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1505-2-4", "zh": "issa，意思是“嫉妒”。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1505-5-6", "zh": "issati（嫉妒）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1505-7-11", "zh": "天神们不会嫉妒人的努力。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1505-12-15", "zh": "issā（嫉妒）、issāyanā（嫉妒）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1506-2-4", "zh": "namassa，意思是“礼敬、顶礼”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1506-5-21", "zh": "所谓“礼敬顶礼”，就是称为礼敬的俯身敬拜；这个词根只是及物的，不像 namu 词根那样既可以是及物的，也可以是不及物的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1506-22-23", "zh": "namassati（礼敬）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-1507-2-4", "zh": "ghusa，意思是“发声”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1507-5-8", "zh": "ghusati、ghosati（发声、宣告）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1507-9-14", "zh": "paṭighoso（回声）、nigghoso（声响）、vacīghoso（言语声）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1508-2-5", "zh": "cusa，意思是“吸饮”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1508-6-7", "zh": "cusati（吸饮）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1509-2-4", "zh": "pusa，意思是“增长、滋养”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-1509-5-6", "zh": "pusati（滋养）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1509-7-8", "zh": "poso（人）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1509-9-12", "zh": "在困苦的时候养育我。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1509-13-16", "zh": "posana 就是养育、使之成长。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1510-2-4", "zh": "musa，意思是“偷盗”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1510-5-8", "zh": "thenana、theyya 就是偷窃。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1510-9-10", "zh": "musati（偷盗）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1510-11-13", "zh": "难以看清，夺人眼目。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-1510-14-15", "zh": "musalo（杵）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1511-2-4", "zh": "pusa，意思是“生出”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1511-5-6", "zh": "pusati（生出）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1512-2-5", "zh": "vāsi、bhūsa，意思是“装饰”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1512-6-7", "zh": "vāsati（装饰）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1512-8-11", "zh": "bhūsati、vibhūsati（装饰）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1512-12-15", "zh": "bhūsanaṃ（装饰）、vibhūsanaṃ（装饰）。", "confidence": 85}
